WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.925 line:82%
Chapter 14. The Students page: names, phones and levels.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:11.224 line:82%
Open "Students". This is your class list: one name on each line.

00:00:11.675 --> 00:00:20.766 line:82%
To fix a spelling, change the name on its line: the student keeps their results. For a new student, add a line. Then press "Save class".

00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:25.824 line:82%
Your list is in Excel? Press "Import", and choose the file.

00:00:26.277 --> 00:00:32.565 line:82%
"Class details" has the class name, the level and book, the school, the class hours, and the room.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:37.025 line:82%
No list? Press "Invite students to add their names".

00:00:37.482 --> 00:00:42.525 line:82%
Students scan the code, write their first and last name, and choose an animal.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:04.099 line:82%
A typed name waits for your OK. Press "Accept", or "Refuse". Then press "Done".

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:09.880 line:82%
One name per phone. In a test, the first phone that taps a name keeps it.

00:01:12.419 --> 00:01:19.060 line:82%
If another phone tries the same name, it can't. A yellow box tells you who tried. Press "OK".

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:27.079 line:82%
A student who tapped the wrong name taps "This is not my name". You press "Free", and the student taps their own name.

00:01:27.538 --> 00:01:30.860 line:82%
Next time, the phone joins by itself.

00:01:42.876 --> 00:01:53.297 line:82%
New phone, or a mix-up? On the Students page, "Students' phones" shows who has a phone. Press "Unlink" for one student, or "Unlink all phones".

00:01:53.749 --> 00:02:02.699 line:82%
"Student levels": the app gives each student a level from their tests. Starter, Explorer or Champion. Change any student here.

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:08.397 line:82%
The level changes the help in Time to speak, and the word lists in Send to learn.

00:02:08.852 --> 00:02:13.857 line:82%
At the bottom: reading help, and the parents' phones. See chapter 13.
